\item[S2] Rongjin Su, Gang Fang and Enqiang Zhu, The Total Coloring Conjecture Holds for Planar Graphs Without Three Special Subgraphs, arXiv:2507.12737v1 (2025), Section 1, Conjecture 1.1, and Section 2 simple-graph convention. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2507.12737v1}.
